{
  "active_latest_entries": 79,
  "retained_exact_entries": 21,
  "disabled_old_entries": [
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_01",
      "reasons": [
        "cue_phrase_absent",
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "肺里像着了火。脚下的地越来越软。身后某处，一条狗叫了一声，又停了。",
      "latest_quote": "你拨开刺枝钻了进去。脚下的地越来越软。身后某处，一根树枝咔地断了。你屏住呼吸，直到确定那只是树皮冻裂的声音。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_02",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "树缝里有灯。也可能只是水面映着月亮。你已经分不清了。",
      "latest_quote": "树缝里有光。是灯，还是水面映着月亮？你已经分不清了。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_CHOICE_STONE_1",
      "reasons": [
        "cue_phrase_absent",
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "你的手握住一块石头。冰凉，小得派不上用场。",
      "latest_quote": "你的手摸到一块石头，攥紧了。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_10",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "送信的活儿派我来的。没人派我去追人。我跑得不够快，吓不着谁。",
      "latest_quote": "派我？大概是送信这份差事吧。信又不会自己走路，真可惜。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_11",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "他越过你，望向你来的方向。笑意淡了些。",
      "latest_quote": "他把你打量了一遍：头发上的霜，靴子的惨状。笑意收了些，换成一种小心。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_12",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "不过，倒是有人派了他们。",
      "latest_quote": "你是从雪里走出来的？靠两条腿？"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_13",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "他们？",
      "latest_quote": "……那又怎样？"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_14",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "那些灯。在河边。雾一起，他们就丢了你的踪迹。天一亮，他们会再找到的。",
      "latest_quote": "不怎样。只是从那边来的人，多半走不到这儿。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_15",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "你没有回头。你信不过自己。",
      "latest_quote": "他等着你往下说。可你没有接下去。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_16",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "你一直在跑。",
      "latest_quote": "迷路了？"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_17",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "你也是。",
      "latest_quote": "……差不多吧。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_18",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "我跑是有工钱的。你看起来像是一停下来就要付出代价。",
      "latest_quote": "啊，那正好。找到这地方最好的法子就是迷路。没人是特意来的。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_CHOICE_NO_1",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "嗯。没有。见过的话，我会记得。",
      "latest_quote": "嗯……那大概是我认错人了。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_CHOICE_NOT_SURE_1",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "那就是你长了一张让人觉得眼熟的脸。",
      "latest_quote": "不知道？行吧，你想留点神秘，那就留着。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_CHOICE_PULL_AWAY_1",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "他由着你。他没有不高兴，倒像是把什么事默默记下了。",
      "latest_quote": "他由着你，也没有不高兴，只是把自己的手收了回去。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_27",
      "reasons": [
        "cue_phrase_absent",
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "远远的身后，狗又叫了。比刚才近。",
      "latest_quote": "你回头望向来的方向。只有树，和树后面的一片白。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_28",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "好。听我的。",
      "latest_quote": "在等人？"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_29",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "那几棵树后面有条小溪。走在水里，别走岸上，一直走到林子变稀。",
      "latest_quote": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_30",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "那你呢？",
      "latest_quote": "那就好。我只有这一只水壶。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_31",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "给我一样你贴身穿过的东西。",
      "latest_quote": "好了。你不能在这儿过夜，就算在雪线这一边，夜里的寒气也要人命。前面不远就有个叫背风地的村子。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_32",
      "reasons": [
        "cue_phrase_absent",
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "你把围巾递给他。他一句话没说，绕在了自己脖子上。",
      "latest_quote": "我得先给烧炭的老芬恩送封信。你顺着溪水的方向走，走不出一里地我就追上你。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_33",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "我带它们往反方向跑一里地，再回来追上你。走。",
      "latest_quote": "你还没来得及说你什么都没答应，他已经消失在树丛里了。水壶还在你手里。"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_01",
      "reasons": [
        "cue_phrase_absent",
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "一个钟头后，他追了上来，膝盖以下全湿透了，一脸得意。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_02",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "它们往反方向去了。狗最爱围巾。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_03",
      "reasons": [
        "cue_phrase_absent",
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "他把围巾还给你。围巾被他的脖子捂得还是暖的。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_04",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "好了。既然没人告诉过你，有两件事你得知道。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_05",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "第一，在背风地，没人问你是从哪儿来的。你也别问他们。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_06",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "第二，别一个人进村。那里的人见过兵。在路边的立石那儿等我，我带你进去。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_07",
      "reasons": [
        "cue_phrase_absent",
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "他在一丛黑刺李边蹲下，摘了一颗果子，皱眉看了看，放进你掌心。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_08",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "留着。现在还涩。等下过第一场霜，就值点东西了。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_09",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "背风地是什么地方？",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_10",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "冬天吞掉他们的城镇以后，逃难的人在这儿停了脚。这么远的地方，帝国懒得来找。看你这样子，正合适。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_11",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "往北有一条獾踩出来的小路，顺着走就到立石。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_12",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "你不一起走？",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_13",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "我跑得快。我先去背风地，告诉他们有人要来。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_14",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "他们会先让你吃饱，再问你别的。这是规矩。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_15",
      "reasons": [
        "cue_phrase_absent",
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "他已经倒退着走开了，咧着嘴笑。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_16",
      "reasons": [
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "别一脸担心。你到的时候，我会在那儿。我一向都在。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_17",
      "reasons": [
        "cue_phrase_absent",
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "然后他转身跑进了林子。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_RULES_18",
      "reasons": [
        "cue_phrase_absent",
        "latest_prose_changed_or_removed",
        "marker_changed_or_removed",
        "not_in_latest_active_story"
      ],
      "patch_quote": "你把围巾重新绕回脖子上。上面还有他的体温。",
      "latest_quote": ""
    }
  ],
  "unmapped_latest_entries": [
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_THAW_01",
      "quote_zh": "哈……哈……不行了。真不行了，一步也走不动了。",
      "story_id": "story.hero.thaw_edge",
      "line_index": 0,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.thaw_edge:0::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_THAW_02",
      "quote_zh": "天啊，好累……多久没合眼了？两夜？还是三夜？",
      "story_id": "story.hero.thaw_edge",
      "line_index": 1,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.thaw_edge:1::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_THAW_03",
      "quote_zh": "脚……我已经感觉不到自己的脚了。",
      "story_id": "story.hero.thaw_edge",
      "line_index": 2,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.thaw_edge:2::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_THAW_04",
      "quote_zh": "狗叫声也听不见了。也许……跟丢了？不。他们不会停下的。",
      "story_id": "story.hero.thaw_edge",
      "line_index": 3,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.thaw_edge:3::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_THAW_05",
      "quote_zh": "……嗯？",
      "story_id": "story.hero.thaw_edge",
      "line_index": 4,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.thaw_edge:4::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_THAW_06",
      "quote_zh": "等等。等一下，这是——",
      "story_id": "story.hero.thaw_edge",
      "line_index": 5,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.thaw_edge:5::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_THAW_07",
      "quote_zh": "是地。黑泥，枯草，湿头发似的贴在地上。……是草啊。",
      "story_id": "story.hero.thaw_edge",
      "line_index": 6,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.thaw_edge:6::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_THAW_08",
      "quote_zh": "雪……到这儿就停了？不可能。雪从来只进不退。",
      "story_id": "story.hero.thaw_edge",
      "line_index": 7,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.thaw_edge:7::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_THAW_09",
      "quote_zh": "啊……这是什么地方？我到底跑到哪儿来了？",
      "story_id": "story.hero.thaw_edge",
      "line_index": 8,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.thaw_edge:8::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_DOUBT_01",
      "quote_zh": "……树。",
      "story_id": "story.hero.wood_doubt",
      "line_index": 0,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.wood_doubt:0::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_DOUBT_02",
      "quote_zh": "这灌木……密得像堵墙，底下黑得像口井。",
      "story_id": "story.hero.wood_doubt",
      "line_index": 1,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.wood_doubt:1::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_DOUBT_03",
      "quote_zh": "马……应该钻不进去吧？狗呢？地这么湿，它们还闻得出我的气味吗？",
      "story_id": "story.hero.wood_doubt",
      "line_index": 2,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.wood_doubt:2::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_DOUBT_05",
      "quote_zh": "天知道里头有什么。",
      "story_id": "story.hero.wood_doubt",
      "line_index": 3,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.wood_doubt:3::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_DOUBT_06",
      "quote_zh": "不过……要是我能钻进去呢？",
      "story_id": "story.hero.wood_doubt",
      "line_index": 4,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.wood_doubt:4::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_DOUBT_07",
      "quote_zh": "说不定，他们就找不着我了。说不定。",
      "story_id": "story.hero.wood_doubt",
      "line_index": 5,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.wood_doubt:5::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_HERO_DOUBT_08",
      "quote_zh": "……怎么样？要不要试一试？",
      "story_id": "story.hero.wood_doubt",
      "line_index": 6,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.hero.wood_doubt:6::0"
    },
