      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:11::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_12",
      "quote_zh": "你是从雪里走出来的？靠两条腿？",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 12,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:12::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_13",
      "quote_zh": "……那又怎样？",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 13,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:13::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_14",
      "quote_zh": "不怎样。只是从那边来的人，多半走不到这儿。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 14,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:14::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_15",
      "quote_zh": "他等着你往下说。可你没有接下去。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 15,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:15::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_16",
      "quote_zh": "迷路了？",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 16,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:16::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_17",
      "quote_zh": "……差不多吧。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 17,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:17::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_18",
      "quote_zh": "啊，那正好。找到这地方最好的法子就是迷路。没人是特意来的。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 18,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:18::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DIALOGUE_CHOOSE_REPLY",
      "quote_zh": "你会怎么说？",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 12,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:12::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_CHOICE_NO_1",
      "quote_zh": "嗯……那大概是我认错人了。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 27,
      "branch_choice": "no",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:27:no:0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_CHOICE_NOT_SURE_1",
      "quote_zh": "不知道？行吧，你想留点神秘，那就留着。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 27,
      "branch_choice": "not_sure",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:27:not_sure:0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_CHOICE_PULL_AWAY_1",
      "quote_zh": "他由着你，也没有不高兴，只是把自己的手收了回去。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 27,
      "branch_choice": "pull_away",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:27:pull_away:0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_27",
      "quote_zh": "你回头望向来的方向。只有树，和树后面的一片白。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 28,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:28::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_28",
      "quote_zh": "在等人？",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 29,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:29::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_29",
      "quote_zh": "没有。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 30,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:30::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_30",
      "quote_zh": "那就好。我只有这一只水壶。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 31,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:31::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_31",
      "quote_zh": "好了。你不能在这儿过夜，就算在雪线这一边，夜里的寒气也要人命。前面不远就有个叫背风地的村子。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 32,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:32::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_32",
      "quote_zh": "我得先给烧炭的老芬恩送封信。你顺着溪水的方向走，走不出一里地我就追上你。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 33,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:33::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_EDGE_33",
      "quote_zh": "你还没来得及说你什么都没答应，他已经消失在树丛里了。水壶还在你手里。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.edge",
      "line_index": 34,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.edge:34::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_01",
      "quote_zh": "不到一个钟头，他追了上来，膝盖以下全湿透了，一脸得意。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 0,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:0::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_02",
      "quote_zh": "你在这儿啊。冻成那样的人，走得倒不慢。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 1,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:1::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_03",
      "quote_zh": "前面的树稀了。树后面升着炊烟，炊烟底下是一片屋顶。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 2,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:2::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_04",
      "quote_zh": "看见了吧。那就是背风地。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 3,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:3::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_05",
      "quote_zh": "这种地方也有人住？",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 4,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:4::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_06",
      "quote_zh": "现在有了。白老妇吞掉他们的城镇以后，逃难的人就在这儿停了脚。这么远的地方，帝国懒得来找。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 5,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:5::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_07",
      "quote_zh": "地方不大。一座磨坊，一口井，羊比人多。可雪从来没到过这儿。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 6,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:6::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_08",
      "quote_zh": "从来没有？",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 7,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:7::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_09",
      "quote_zh": "还没有。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 8,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:8::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_10",
      "quote_zh": "不过你别一个人进村。那里的人见过兵，对生面孔不客气。跟着我走。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 9,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:9::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_11",
      "quote_zh": "他迈开步子，又猛地站住，你差点撞到他背上。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 10,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:10::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_12",
      "quote_zh": "圣徒在上。我跟你说了这么半天，连你叫什么都没问。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 11,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:11::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_CHOICE_TELL_1",
      "quote_zh": "你把名字告诉了他。他跟着念了一遍。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 12,
      "branch_choice": "tell",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:12:tell:0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_CHOICE_TELL_2",
      "quote_zh": "我叫奥辛。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 12,
      "branch_choice": "tell",
      "branch_index": 1,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:12:tell:1"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_CHOICE_YOU_FIRST_1",
      "quote_zh": "行，公平。我叫奥辛。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 12,
      "branch_choice": "you_first",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:12:you_first:0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_CHOICE_YOU_FIRST_2",
      "quote_zh": "他等着。你把名字告诉了他。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 12,
      "branch_choice": "you_first",
      "branch_index": 1,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:12:you_first:1"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_CHOICE_SILENT_1",
      "quote_zh": "不想说也行。我叫奥辛，等你想说了再告诉我。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 12,
      "branch_choice": "silent",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:12:silent:0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_13",
      "quote_zh": "走吧。他们会先让你吃饱，再问你别的。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 13,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:13::0"
    },
    {
      "text_key": "DLG_MESSENGER_CATCH_14",
      "quote_zh": "你跟着他，朝炊烟走去。",
      "story_id": "story.messenger.catch_up",
      "line_index": 14,
      "branch_choice": "",
      "branch_index": 0,
      "marker": "story.messenger.catch_up:14::0"
    }
  ],
